              {
                "uuid": "d7407a47-00fe-4b8d-b37b-0fec55cd2aa2",
                "control-id": "SP_800_171_03.13.01",
                "description": "The intake Lambda runs inside the VPC's private subnets with a security group that has no inbound rules and only HTTPS egress to the S3 and DynamoDB gateway endpoints. There is no internet route and no NAT gateway.",
